ell\nvolume_mismatch = radius**2 * height_original  # Volume of the original cone\n\n# Volume of height reduced cone\n# We need to solve for the height of the shorter cone, let's adjust calculations again.\n# volume_original = volume_correct, min calculation rounding errors\nheight_shorter = 192 / 64 \n\n# Ratio\nheight_ratio = height_shorter / height_original\n\nheight_ratio_fraction = height_ratio\n\nprint((height_original, height_shorter, height_ratio))\n```",
